  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "Create a process for monitoring your team's hours where your goal is to make sure their workloads are sustainable and strategically sound. \n\n### Review work hours \n\nDevelop and agree with your team on a simple and effective way for keeping tabs on your team's hours. The key is making sure that each person's time spent on a project matches the overall strategy and objectives - if they are spending too much or too little time, ask them to flag it. \n\n### Make adjustments\n\nIf you see that a team member isn't completing tasks within projected work hours, schedule a 1:1 or team meeting to discuss how to be more efficient and sustain better balance.",
